stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Loading: Component mounted
    Loading --> Success: API call successful
    Loading --> Error: API call failed

    Success --> Filtering: User applies filter
    Success --> Sorting: User changes sort
    Success --> Paginating: User navigates pages

    Filtering --> Success: Filter applied
    Sorting --> Success: Sort applied
    Paginating --> Success: Page changed

    Success --> CopyingHash: User clicks copy
    CopyingHash --> Success: Hash copied

    Success --> DownloadingReceipt: User clicks download
    DownloadingReceipt --> Success: Receipt downloaded

    Success --> Refreshing: User clicks refresh
    Refreshing --> Loading: Refetch initiated

    Error --> Retrying: User clicks retry
    Retrying --> Loading: Retry initiated

    Success --> [*]: Component unmounted
    Error --> [*]: Component unmounted

    note right of Success
        Data cached in React Query
        Local filtering/sorting/pagination
        No API calls for UI interactions
    end note

    note right of Error
        Display error message
        Show retry button
        Preserve previous data if available
    end note
